==============================================================================
ADJUDICATION ADDENDUM (post-run, from m2_ampladder_data.npz)
==============================================================================
The raw analysis above flags V-growth "violations" and collapse "breaks".
Both are NOISE-FLOOR ARTIFACTS, not nonlinear signatures:

1) SHARED V FLOOR. V_end = 4.78e-16 / 4.60e-16 / 7.09e-16 / 1.35e-15 across
   V0 spanning SIX decades (8.6e-8 .. 8.6e-2). Linear dynamics all the way
   down would give V_end proportional to amp^2; instead every trajectory
   lands on the same absolute floor. ALL flagged violations occur at V in
   [3.1e-16, 8.2e-16] -- inside the floor band. The absolute raw floor
   (2.9e-10 .. 7.6e-10) sits at the step tolerance (1e-10): this is the
   march's own noise level, reached after 8+ decades of genuine decay.
   The inverted amp-ordering of violation counts (15/13/5/0 for increasing
   amp) is exactly the floor signature: larger amps reach the floor later.
   HEADLINE TEST RESULT: NO genuine P-norm growth at ANY amplitude. At
   amp=1e-3, V fell 13.8 decades with ZERO violations.

2) COLLAPSE "BREAK" AT s~36 IS THE CONTROL'S FLOOR. The break-s is
   IDENTICAL (35.75-36.5) across amps spanning two decades -- a genuine
   nonlinear break would move DOWN in s with increasing amp. The deviation
   direction confirms it: shape_amp/shape_ctrl at s=60 = 0.104 / 0.0147 /
   0.0025 (monotone in amp) -- the CONTROL (raw0=1e-6, absolute floor hit
   first, at relative 3e-4) flattens while larger amps keep genuinely
   decaying toward their own floors. Collapse holds within measurement
   resolution until the control's floor, i.e. NO amplitude-dependent
   dynamics detected in the shape.

3) THE ONE GENUINE NONLINEAR FINGERPRINT: the transient peak factor drifts
   2.388799 / 2.388867 / 2.389401 / 2.394759 -- monotone in amp, +0.25% at
   amp=1e-3. Amplitude dependence is real, resolvable, and TINY. This is
   the first direct nonlinear-sector measurement of the campaign.

CORRECTED M2 READOUT:
  - escape threshold NOT FOUND up to amp=1e-3: all four marches completed
    60 s-units with the true residual converged every step (worst 9.94e-11,
    max 5 QN iterations). Basin radius >= 1e-3 in this direction (seed 0).
  - s_transient = 13.5 s-units, AMPLITUDE-INDEPENDENT across 3 decades.
  - measurement floor for future finite-amp work: raw ~3e-10 absolute
    (= step tol); V ~5e-16. Probing deeper needs a tighter step_tol.
